bsp;suspendendo&nbsp;a</strong></p><p><strong>exigibilidade&nbsp;das&nbsp;custas&nbsp;e&nbsp;despesas&nbsp;processuais&nbsp;(Art.&nbsp;98,&nbsp;§&nbsp;3º,&nbsp;CPC).&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Arbitro&nbsp;os&nbsp;honorários&nbsp;advocatícios&nbsp;em&nbsp;favor&nbsp;da&nbsp;Curadora&nbsp;Especial&nbsp;nomeada</strong></p><p><strong>às&nbsp;fls.&nbsp;46&nbsp;no&nbsp;valor&nbsp;máximo&nbsp;previsto&nbsp;na&nbsp;Tabela&nbsp;do&nbsp;Convênio&nbsp;Defensoria/OAB&#x2011;SP&nbsp;para&nbsp;a</strong></p><p><strong>respectiva&nbsp;classe&nbsp;de&nbsp;ação.&nbsp;Com&nbsp;o&nbsp;trânsito&nbsp;em&nbsp;julgado,&nbsp;expeça&#x2011;se&nbsp;a&nbsp;certidão&nbsp;de&nbsp;honorários.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Após&nbsp;o&nbsp;trânsito&nbsp;em&nbsp;julgado,&nbsp;intime&#x2011;se&nbsp;a&nbsp;curadora&nbsp;para&nbsp;assinar&nbsp;o&nbsp;Termo&nbsp;de</strong></p><p><strong>Curatela&nbsp;Definitiva&nbsp;em&nbsp;cartório,&nbsp;no&nbsp;prazo&nbsp;de&nbsp;05&nbsp;(cinco)&nbsp;dias.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Ciência&nbsp;ao&nbsp;Ministério&nbsp;Público.</strong></p><p><strong>Oportunamente,&nbsp;arquivem&#x2011;se&nbsp;os&nbsp;autos.</strong></p><p><strong>P.I.C.&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Jales,&nbsp;09&nbsp;de&nbsp;setembro&nbsp;de&nbsp;2026&nbsp;</strong></p>
